  "reason": "The strongest completed result is RNA-only multiprofile with scvi_n200 and avgpool (config_005, 0.650 acc / 0.628 F1), while image-only ResNet50 is weak (config_010, 0.208 acc). The key uncertainty is whether adding image features to the best RNA representation can improve validation accuracy, and whether a simple concat fusion is sufficient. config_030 keeps the best RNA encoder, profile setting, and aggregation fixed, then adds ResNet50 image features with concat fusion, making it a direct extension of config_005. This is the best next use of budget because it tests the central multimodal question with minimal additional complexity and will clarify whether further investment in image encoders or more complex fusion is justified."
}

